82, "no_speech_prob": 0.010696920566260815}, {"id": 39, "seek": 24260, "start": 242.6, "end": 247.07999999999998, "text": " It's very emotional to see it in real life.", "tokens": [50364, 467, 311, 588, 6863, 281, 536, 309, 294, 957, 993, 13, 50588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1625493884086609, "compression_ratio": 1.4773869346733668, "no_speech_prob": 0.4652092158794403}, {"id": 40, "seek": 24260, "start": 247.07999999999998, "end": 254.44, "text": " It's completely different from seeing a reproduction of it in a book or online.", "tokens": [50588, 467, 311, 2584, 819, 490, 2577, 257, 33934, 295, 309, 294, 257, 1446, 420, 2950, 13, 50956], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1625493884086609, "compression_ratio": 1.4773869346733668, "no_speech_prob": 0.4652092158794403}, {"id": 41, "seek": 24260, "start": 254.44, "end": 259.2, "text": " She told the French news agency, AFP,", "tokens": [50956, 1240, 1907, 264, 5522, 2583, 7934, 11, 20389, 47, 11, 51194], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1625493884086609, "compression_ratio": 1.4773869346733668, "no_speech_prob": 0.4652092158794403}, {"id": 42, "seek": 24260, "start": 259.2, "end": 265.76, "text": " People can see how big it is, how beautiful the colors and the gold still are.", "tokens": [51194, 3432, 393, 536, 577, 955, 309, 307, 11, 577, 2238, 264, 4577, 293, 264, 3821, 920, 366, 13, 51522], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1625493884086609, "compression_ratio": 1.4773869346733668, "no_speech_prob": 0.4652092158794403}, {"id": 43, "seek": 24260, "start": 265.76, "end": 271.52, "text": " There's a lot of mystery around the Bible, said Rice.", "tokens": [51522, 821, 311, 257, 688, 295, 11422, 926, 264, 6544, 11, 848, 19386, 13, 51810], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1625493884086609, "compression_ratio": 1.4773869346733668, "no_speech_prob": 0.4652092158794403}, {"id": 44, "seek": 27152, "start": 271.52, "end": 276.35999999999996, "text": " How it came to Moutier-Grandval remains unclear.", "tokens": [50364, 1012, 309, 1361, 281, 376, 346, 811, 12, 45076, 3337, 7023, 25636, 13, 50606], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1749983860896184, "compression_ratio": 1.3167701863354038, "no_speech_prob": 0.03867899999022484}, {"id": 45, "seek": 27152, "start": 276.35999999999996, "end": 282.96, "text": " Some people say the Bible was left behind and forgotten about until it was found in", "tokens": [50606, 2188, 561, 584, 264, 6544, 390, 1411, 2261, 293, 11832, 466, 1826, 309, 390, 1352, 294, 50936], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1749983860896184, "compression_ratio": 1.3167701863354038, "no_speech_prob": 0.03867899999022484}, {"id": 46, "seek": 27152, "start": 282.96, "end": 289.12, "text": " Delemon in the late 1810s or early 1820s.", "tokens": [50936, 1346, 306, 3317, 294, 264, 3469, 2443, 3279, 82, 420, 2440, 2443, 2009, 82, 13, 51244], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1749983860896184, "compression_ratio": 1.3167701863354038, "no_speech_prob": 0.03867899999022484}, {"id": 47, "seek": 27152, "start": 289.12, "end": 294.08, "text": " It was sold to an art dealer in 1822.", "tokens": [51244, 467, 390, 3718, 281, 364, 1523, 24896, 294, 2443, 7490, 13, 51492], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1749983860896184, "compression_ratio": 1.3167701863354038, "no_speech_prob": 0.03867899999022484}, {"id": 48, "seek": 29408, "start": 294.08, "end": 305.71999999999997, "text": " The British Museum bought the Bible in 1836 for what is equal to $93,600 in today's money.", "tokens": [50364, 440, 6221, 10967, 4243, 264, 6544, 294, 2443, 11309, 337, 437, 307, 2681, 281, 1848, 26372, 11, 15707, 294, 965, 311, 1460, 13, 50946], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11734760961224956, "compression_ratio": 1.3693181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 0.5414815545082092}, {"id": 49, "seek": 29408, "start": 305.71999999999997, "end": 310.15999999999997, "text": " The Bible even today remains surrounded in mystery.", "tokens": [50946, 440, 6544, 754, 965, 7023, 13221, 294, 11422, 13, 51168], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11734760961224956, "compression_ratio": 1.3693181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 0.5414815545082092}, {"id": 50, "seek": 29408, "start": 310.15999999999997, "end": 317.96, "text": " How it was transported from London to Delemon and all matters of security remain a guarded", "tokens": [51168, 1012, 309, 390, 29373, 490, 7042, 281, 1346, 306, 3317, 293, 439, 7001, 295, 3825, 6222, 257, 44157, 51558], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11734760961224956, "compression_ratio": 1.3693181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 0.5414815545082092}, {"id": 51, "seek": 29408, "start": 317.96, "end": 319.64, "text": " secret.", "tokens": [51558, 4054, 13, 51642], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11734760961224956, "compression_ratio": 1.3693181818181819, "no_speech_prob": 0.5414815545082092}, {"id": 52, "seek": 31964, "start": 319.64, "end": 325.24, "text": " The museum in Jura is showing the Bible until June 8.", "tokens": [50364, 440, 8441, 294, 508, 2991, 307, 4099, 264, 6544, 1826, 6928, 1649, 13, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20927133058246813, "compression_ratio": 1.2222222222222223, "no_speech_prob": 0.6391090154647827}, {"id": 53, "seek": 31964, "start": 325.24, "end": 329.91999999999996, "text": " Experts there hope that the Bible will be shown there again.", "tokens": [50644, 12522, 1373, 456, 1454, 300, 264, 6544, 486, 312, 4898, 456, 797, 13, 50878], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20927133058246813, "compression_ratio": 1.2222222222222223, "no_speech_prob": 0.6391090154647827}, {"id": 54, "seek": 31964, "start": 329.91999999999996, "end": 330.96, "text": " I'm John Russell.", "tokens": [50878, 286, 478, 2619, 20937, 13, 50930], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20927133058246813, "compression_ratio": 1.2222222222222223, "no_speech_prob": 0.6391090154647827}], "language": "en"}